Configuration Options:

  -c, --config <FILE>       Configuration file path
  -e, --env <ENV>           Environment (dev/staging/prod)

LLM Options:

  -m, --model <MODEL>       LLM model name
  -t, --temperature <T>     Temperature (0.0-2.0)
  -p, --max-tokens <N>      Maximum tokens

Output Options:

  -o, --output <FILE>       Output file path
  -f, --format <FMT>        Output format (json/markdown/table)
  -v, --verbose             Verbose output
  -q, --quiet               Quiet mode
